<title>FINLAND: Helsinki bourse, derivs exchange plan restructure.</title>
<headline>Helsinki bourse, derivs exchange plan restructure.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Helsinki Stock Exchange and derivatives exchange SOM Oy said in a statement on Tuesday they would hold a news conference at 1500/1200 GMT on &quot;a significant restructuring&quot; of Finnish securities markets.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
